WEBVTT

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:40.350
<i>Episode 4</i>

00:01:55.640 --> 00:01:58.640
This is our house special: 
our Lu-style chicken combo.

00:01:58.640 --> 00:02:00.890
It is on the house, as our apology to you.

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:06.970
You are so very charming, sir. I like you a lot.

00:02:06.970 --> 00:02:07.930
What are you doing?

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:11.350
Do not be afraid, sir.

00:02:11.350 --> 00:02:13.520
I know a little about the art of massage.

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:16.390
If you are sore at all, I can work my magic.

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:19.520
Talk about taking advantage.
 What idiot would fall for that?

00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:21.930
Really?! That'd be great! Please do!

00:02:21.930 --> 00:02:22.770
Are you stupid?!

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:28.190
Have you been feeling annoyed,
anxious or breathless recently, sir?

00:02:29.470 --> 00:02:32.470
Now that you mention it, a little, yeah.

00:02:32.470 --> 00:02:36.020
Then, you are in luck. I happen to
know a little trick to remedy that.

00:02:36.020 --> 00:02:41.440
If you have no objections,
I can show it to you, sir.

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:48.390
What if I still feel bad afterwards?
Got anything more vigorous?

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:52.770
Then, I will have to use my ultimate technique:
The Ruoyan Deep Tissue Massage.

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:54.780
Mistress Ruoyan! Mistress Ruoyan!

00:02:57.350 --> 00:03:00.090
Mistress Ruoyan, that
troublesome client is here again.

00:03:05.770 --> 00:03:11.640
W-Waiter, b-bring my lord 
the D-D-Dragon Combo.

00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:14.270
Sorry, sir, we do not have this combo.

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:17.640
Th-Then, we will have the b-big combo.

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:23.890
All the private rooms are occupied.

00:03:24.190 --> 00:03:25.020
What?

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:28.520
S-Surely you have w-waiters, d-do you not?

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:30.140
We do indeed. And deals.

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:32.640
Spend over 500 and you
get a free cola with ice.

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:36.520
Spend over 1,000 and you 
get free wine: an '82 Lafite.

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:39.550
Spend over 10,000 and
you get a gold VIP card.

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:43.710
Silence, y-you dog!

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:53.890
My lord is a-already a premier 
b-black card member h-here,

00:03:53.890 --> 00:03:56.620
so you c-can keep your d-discounts.

00:03:58.220 --> 00:04:00.790
My, what an angry outburst.

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:07.270
This man is severely nearsighted.
He did not realize you are valued customers.

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:10.790
Wangcai, prepare the innermost 
room on the second floor.

00:04:11.300 --> 00:04:12.020
Yes, mistress.

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:16.310
Get us a b-big room!

00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:20.100
To what do we owe ​the 
honor of your presence, sir?

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:23.920
My lord s-s-said...

00:04:25.470 --> 00:04:27.520
Ruoyan, did you miss me?

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:32.140
I have left my palace today solely to see you.

00:04:36.180 --> 00:04:41.270
As they say: "For thee, my love, for thee. 
I miss her so, yet ne'er regret how I atrophy."

00:04:41.470 --> 00:04:45.140
Surely a noble like yourself knows
more poems than just that one?

00:04:54.900 --> 00:04:56.100
Let go of me!

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:58.270
Come, let me recite another poem for you.

00:04:58.570 --> 00:05:01.520
Does reciting poetry not
make you overly hot?

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:06.020
Hot? My heart is all aflame,
like wearing a sweater in summer!

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:08.020
Come to the palace with me, Ruoyan.

00:05:08.020 --> 00:05:09.270
Not on your life!

00:05:09.270 --> 00:05:11.140
I will not go to the palace with you!

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:18.750
Ruoyan, I sincerely love you.

00:05:19.930 --> 00:05:22.470
Nobody cares about your sincerity! Let me go!

00:05:22.470 --> 00:05:25.430
No, promise me first.

00:05:32.550 --> 00:05:35.300
Treating me to a chicken dinner
and a special massage...

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:37.390
The proprietress here is really kind.

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:39.180
Do I scan a QR code to pay?

00:05:44.970 --> 00:05:46.530
You are so irksome.

00:05:46.930 --> 00:05:48.350
Let go of me or I will strike you.

00:05:48.350 --> 00:05:52.390
Go ahead and scream yourself hoarse.
No one will come to your rescue.

00:05:49.220 --> 00:05:50.430
Someone in trouble?

00:05:53.640 --> 00:05:56.680
Please, someone! Help me!

00:05:57.680 --> 00:05:58.430
<i>The proprietress?</i>

00:05:58.020 --> 00:06:00.250
Ruoyan, stop screaming. Stop screaming.

00:06:02.350 --> 00:06:03.380
Unhand her!

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:08.430
Where'd you crawl in from, villain?
How dare you harass the kind proprietress!

00:06:09.020 --> 00:06:10.930
Um, sir... why are you here?

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:13.430
We didn't get to finish what we started.

00:06:17.640 --> 00:06:20.180
Ruoyan, you do not love me anymore...

00:06:20.720 --> 00:06:21.970
Hurry up and leave!

00:06:21.970 --> 00:06:25.110
The proprietress still needs to
finish up my massage therapy!

00:06:26.020 --> 00:06:27.680
Massage therapy?!

00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:33.180
I plan on experiencing her
"Ruoyan Deep Tissue Massage" later.

00:06:40.680 --> 00:06:43.470
You wild monkey! How dare 
you steal my love away from me!

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:45.280
I will kill you!

00:06:57.930 --> 00:06:59.350
Stop dodging and fight me!

00:06:59.570 --> 00:07:00.970
Okay, you asked for it.

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:26.470
I will beat you so hard, even 
your mother won't recognize you.

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:29.810
Sir! Do not beat him! Please!

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:39.560
What dog attacks me from the shadows?

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:46.560
Make a m-move t-toward my lord again,

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:49.960
and I m-may end up
e-executing your whole f-family!

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:52.660
What a joke.

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:54.930
I'll kick this weirdo's butt
every time I see him.

00:07:55.600 --> 00:07:58.480
Do not b-blame me then. You asked for this.

00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:37.810
Stop this immediately!
What if my guest gets hurt?

00:08:37.810 --> 00:08:41.430
Fight! Do not stop! I will 
take care of all medical bills!

00:08:37.810 --> 00:08:42.470
<i><i>Uh-oh, this man is highly skilled. And it's too
cramped in here to use psychedelic smoke.</i></i>

00:08:42.470 --> 00:08:43.760
I have to lure him outside.

00:08:44.970 --> 00:08:47.180
Behold, my storm of needles!

00:09:02.430 --> 00:09:05.600
T-Trying to escape?
You will n-not find that so e-easy!

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:25.130
Qingwan, this is your first time here, yes?

00:09:25.560 --> 00:09:28.160
The Drunk Fairy serves some
of the finest food in the capital.

00:09:29.220 --> 00:09:32.430
Since Lord Zimo recommends it,
 it must be a fine place indeed.

00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:28.990
You are a lady?

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:32.220
You... You... Let me go!

00:10:39.020 --> 00:10:40.560
Don't expect a thank you.

00:10:41.150 --> 00:10:43.710
I finally found you, little handmaiden.

00:10:45.060 --> 00:10:47.310
I thought I would never see you again.

00:10:47.850 --> 00:10:49.430
Let go of me! Who are you?

00:10:50.140 --> 00:10:53.020
I am Yu Zimo, the man you 
threw over your shoulder.

00:10:59.770 --> 00:11:01.810
Oh, right, that guy...

00:11:02.390 --> 00:11:03.650
Come and be my princess.

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:06.750
I promise I will make you happy.

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:07.620
No.

00:11:11.570 --> 00:11:12.810
She is coming with me.

00:11:15.220 --> 00:11:18.060
What was that? Since we were kids,
you have always taken my things.

00:11:18.060 --> 00:11:19.240
Well, not this time!

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:22.810
Hey! What do you two think I am?

00:11:23.560 --> 00:11:25.310
Come, do not be angry, please.

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:28.500
I bite. Don't come any closer.

00:11:35.390 --> 00:11:37.770
I did not realize you were such a fair maiden.

00:11:37.770 --> 00:11:39.580
I was most rude to you just now.

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:43.370
Go away!

00:11:53.180 --> 00:11:55.410
My lord, a-are you all right?

00:12:00.460 --> 00:12:01.850
Jun Yiqing.

00:12:01.850 --> 00:12:05.430
Do you not fear our father, the emperor, finding
out you left your palace without permission?

00:12:06.720 --> 00:12:09.100
I left on the orders of our mother.

00:12:09.100 --> 00:12:10.560
Why would our father blame me?

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:14.430
His father, the emperor?
Doesn't that make him a prince too?

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:20.220
Enjoy your conversation. 
This girl belongs to me.

00:12:21.310 --> 00:12:22.930
Who belongs to you?

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:28.930
She is connected to the 
assassin who attacked me.

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:30.470
I will interrogate her.

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:34.710
Brother Ye, can you think up no better excuse?

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:40.470
I thought we came to cheer up Qingwan.
Why are you fighting over a woman?

00:12:43.970 --> 00:12:45.060
Exactly!

00:12:45.060 --> 00:12:48.470
Brother Ye, you insist on taking this
maiden from me, but what of Qingwan?

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:50.400
Please calm yourselves, my lords.

00:12:56.660 --> 00:12:57.630
This is the place!

00:12:58.930 --> 00:13:02.350
How dare they throw me out!
Smash this place to bits!

00:13:02.350 --> 00:13:03.470
Yes, sir!

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:16.810
On second thoughts...

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:18.350
Sorry for bothering you.

00:13:38.100 --> 00:13:40.470
Perfect. I have you to myself.

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:43.710
Let me go! Get away from me!

00:13:44.850 --> 00:13:47.960
You would rather be interrogated
by Prince Ye than come with me?

00:13:48.350 --> 00:13:50.060
I haven't agreed to anything!

00:13:49.170 --> 00:13:51.220
Fret not, my sweet. I will treat you well.

00:13:50.060 --> 00:13:51.220
How interesting.

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:56.430
Yu Princely Palace

00:13:56.430 --> 00:13:56.850
Yu Princely Palace

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:57.100
Yu Princely Palace

00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:57.470
Yu Princely Palace

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:00.100
Hey, wh-what are you doing?

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:02.260
Don't come any closer. I'll do it myself.

00:14:09.270 --> 00:14:10.720
They've finally gone.

00:14:23.100 --> 00:14:25.080
<i><i>I haven't had much luck lately.</i></i>

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:28.840
<i><i>I met three princes all at once.
Each one weirder than the next. </i></i>

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:31.820
<i><i>This Yu Zimo character is
definitely up to no good too.</i></i>

00:14:33.020 --> 00:14:35.320
<i><i>Why hasn't Mochi come to save me yet?</i></i>

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:38.970
Something's... draining my power.

00:14:40.100 --> 00:14:42.680
<i>I can't stay here too long.
I have to find a way out of here.</i>

00:14:43.470 --> 00:14:45.430
My lady, you are very beautiful.

00:14:45.430 --> 00:14:48.360
No wonder His Highness,
Prince Yu, is so taken with you.

00:14:49.270 --> 00:14:50.520
What are you talking about?

00:14:50.520 --> 00:14:51.470
Your Highness.

00:14:51.850 --> 00:14:53.470
You handmaidens may leave now.

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:55.340
Excuse us, Your Highness.

00:14:59.390 --> 00:15:02.470
Thank you for helping me.
I'll be sure to pay you back someday.

00:15:08.310 --> 00:15:08.990
Wait.

00:15:09.770 --> 00:15:13.970
Stay. I know this situation is hard for you.
But I fell in love with you at first sight.

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:15.150
Become my princess.

00:15:15.970 --> 00:15:16.580
No chance.

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:18.600
You refuse? But why?

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:21.430
Your Highness.

00:15:21.430 --> 00:15:22.850
Can you not see I am busy?

00:15:23.050 --> 00:15:25.350
Your Highness, Eunuch Ji is here.

00:15:26.350 --> 00:15:28.930
The atmosphere has been ruined!

00:15:28.930 --> 00:15:30.350
I do not wish to leave, even for a second—

00:15:30.350 --> 00:15:31.220
Just get out.

00:15:32.020 --> 00:15:34.320
Worry not! I shall return anon!

00:15:32.970 --> 00:15:34.320
I'm <i>not</i> worried!

00:15:39.600 --> 00:15:42.470
Despite all his sweet talk,
he still leaves without a second thought.

00:15:43.720 --> 00:15:45.060
The perfect time to escape.

00:15:47.850 --> 00:15:48.770
What's this thing?

00:15:59.430 --> 00:16:02.470
Your Highness, I took this portrait
and asked around the palace.

00:16:02.470 --> 00:16:05.260
I discovered that there is 
no such maid in the palace.

00:16:05.970 --> 00:16:06.640
Your Highness?

00:16:07.140 --> 00:16:07.830
Your Highness?

00:16:08.930 --> 00:16:09.530
Yes?

00:16:10.270 --> 00:16:15.100
But Su Rong said the girl in the 
portrait looked like someone else.

00:16:16.430 --> 00:16:17.350
Who?

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:19.850
The princess in the Serenity Pavilion.

00:16:21.810 --> 00:16:25.170
It seems we must pay a visit
to the Yu Princely Palace.
